一起用。","verify":"\"We visited a museum yesterday.\""},{"id":"cne_j090_q1","topicId":"cne_j090","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的 -ed 读 /ɪd/？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"played"},{"key":"B","text":"stopped"},{"key":"C","text":"cleaned"},{"key":"D","text":"visited"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"visited 的 -ed 在 /t/ 后读 /ɪd/。","verify":"\"visited\""},{"id":"cne_j090_q2","topicId":"cne_j090","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"stopped 的 -ed 和哪个词同类？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"watched"},{"key":"B","text":"played"},{"key":"C","text":"lived"},{"key":"D","text":"needed"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"stopped 和 watched 的 -ed 都读 /t/。","verify":"\"watched\""},{"id":"cne_j090_q3","topicId":"cne_j090","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"played 的 -ed 和哪个词同类？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"stopped"},{"key":"B","text":"cleaned"},{"key":"C","text":"watched"},{"key":"D","text":"visited"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"played 和 cleaned 的 -ed 都读 /d/。","verify":"\"cleaned\""},{"id":"cne_j090_q4","topicId":"cne_j090","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"needed 的词尾读什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"/t/"},{"key":"B","text":"/d/"},{"key":"C","text":"/ɪd/"},{"key":"D","text":"不发音"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"needed 以 /d/ 结尾，-ed 读 /ɪd/。","verify":"\"/ɪd/\""},{"id":"cne_j091_q1","topicId":"cne_j091","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问对方的郊游怎么样，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"How was your school trip?"},{"key":"B","text":"How is your school trip yesterday?"},{"key":"C","text":"How were your school trip?"},{"key":"D","text":"What was your school trip like did?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"How was your school trip。","verify":"\"How was your school trip?\""},{"id":"cne_j091_q2","topicId":"cne_j091","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"郊游很有趣，应怎么说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It were interesting."},{"key":"B","text":"It was interesting."},{"key":"C","text":"It was interest."},{"key":"D","text":"It is interesting yesterday."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"It was interesting。","verify":"\"It was interesting.\""},{"id":"cne_j091_q3","topicId":"cne_j091","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Did you see any cows? 你看到了，应回答什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Yes, I do."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, I saw."},{"key":"C","text":"Yes, I did."},{"key":"D","text":"Yes, I was."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Did 提问用 did 简答。","verify":"\"Yes, I did.\""},{"id":"cne_j091_q4","topicId":"cne_j091","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"想说我们给奶牛挤了奶，哪一句合适？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"We milk a cow yesterday."},{"key":"B","text":"We did milked a cow."},{"key":"C","text":"We milking a cow."},{"key":"D","text":"We milked a cow."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"milked 是过去式。","verify":"\"We milked a cow.\""},{"id":"cne_j092_q1","topicId":"cne_j092","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"June 5th. The trip was great. We visited a farm. We milked a cow and saw many flowers. 他们去了哪里？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"博物馆"},{"key":"B","text":"农场"},{"key":"C","text":"消防站"},{"key":"D","text":"学校"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"visited a farm。","verify":"\"农场\""},{"id":"cne_j092_q2","topicId":"cne_j092","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"June 5th. The trip was great. We visited a farm. We milked a cow and saw many flowers. 旅行感觉怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"很糟糕"},{"key":"B","text":"一般"},{"key":"C","text":"很棒"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没说"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"was great。","verify":"\"很棒\""},{"id":"cne_j092_q3","topicId":"cne_j092","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The weather was bad. It rained. We did not take any photos. 他们拍照了吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"拍了很多"},{"key":"B","text":"只拍了花"},{"key":"C","text":"短文没说"},{"key":"D","text":"没有"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"did not take any photos。","verify":"\"没有\""},{"id":"cne_j092_q4","topicId":"cne_j092","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The weather was bad. It rained. 哪一句和日记一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It rained and the weather was bad."},{"key":"B","text":"The weather was great."},{"key":"C","text":"They took many photos."},{"key":"D","text":"They milked a cow in this text."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"天气不好并且下了雨。这段没有写挤奶。","verify":"\"It rained and the weather was bad.\""}]
